A property that passes may test little, so each property names the classes of its cases.

This table says, for a property, the percentage of its cases that a class must reach.

Each minimum is about a third of the share seen at 1,000 cases of the driver.

A slow property runs 20 or 50 of them, so its minimums are set lower than a third.
-/

